  "details": "so it's no surprise that nsfw activities happen in VR, but the problem with this is that there's way too many kids in the game and them being exposed to it is not good in the slightest. I recommend maybe making a system where we'd need to hold an ID up with our face in a picture and a close up of the ID. This would add an +18 tag to your account and let you open up unique instances of worlds or areas that would allow that content. For the worlds that aren't +18 you could crack down really hard on any inappropriate content. It's not a perfect system, but I say it's better than nothing. A little bit of filtering to protect the people who shouldn't be seeing that stuff. It could always be expanded upon!",
